*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : FEE0009
*> PURPOSE : FEE EXEMPTIONS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : M.S.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1992-06-19 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-10-06 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 525
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FEENIGHT STEP090
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FEE0009.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    COPY FEE0009C.
01 WS-OUT-REC.
    05 WAIVE-IND          PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    05 SVC-CHARGE         PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM FEE-CONCESSION
    DISPLAY "WAIVE-IND=" WAIVE-IND
    DISPLAY "SVC-CHARGE=" SVC-CHARGE
    STOP RUN.
FEE-CONCESSION.
    *> STUDENT FEE WAIVER - LIMIT 37 PER 1998 POLICY
    IF STUDENT-FLAG EQUAL TO 'Y' AND CLNT-AGE < 25
        MOVE 'Y' TO WAIVE-IND
        MOVE 0 TO SVC-CHARGE
    *> SENIOR FEE WAIVER - LIMIT 97 PER 1998 POLICY
    ELSE IF CLNT-AGE >= 65
        MOVE 'Y' TO WAIVE-IND
        MOVE 0 TO SVC-CHARGE
    ELSE
        MOVE 6 TO SVC-CHARGE
    END-IF
    END-IF.
